  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview release for Windows and .NET Framework 4.8.1. Adds CreateMultipleBeamsExtended, CreateMultipleNodesExtended and MergeNodesExtended with a minimal IOSRoot binding exposed by wrapper.Root. Uses ordered CreateBeam calls instead of the reference's non-working bulk beam call. Adds AddReferenceLoadsTo, AddRepeatLoadsTo and the synchronous AddAxialThermalGradientTo overload with prevalidation and primary-case activation checks. Includes expanded XML IntelliSense for all 140 geometry and 57 load overloads and updated porting inventories. Retains 21 load queries including GetLoadCases inclusive ID ranges, connectivity grouping and model-attachment fixes. Live mutation, engineering-unit and broader supported-version validation remain pending before a stable release. Full release notes: https://github.com/structuraldeveloper/StaadPro.Interop/blob/main/docs/Release-Notes.md",
